2026-10-30 07:38:00 INFO areno.api.trainers.policy_only.PolicyOnlyTrainer policy_only.py:723 - rollout_completion={"kind": "rollout", "epoch": 0, "step": 12, "prompt_idx": 0, "sample_idx": 0, "prompt": "Solve the following grade-school math problem. Show your reasoning and put the final answer in \\boxed{}.\n\nProblem: Nico borrows 3 books from the library on Monday.  On Monday, he reads the first book with a total of 20 pages.  On Tuesday, he reads the second book with a total of 12 pages.  On Wednesday, he reads the third book.  If he has read a total of 51 pages from Monday to Wednesday, how many pages did he read on Wednesday?\nSolution:", "decoded_prompt": "<|im_start|>user\nSolve the following grade-school math problem. Show your reasoning and put the final answer in \\boxed{}.\n\nProblem: Nico borrows 3 books from the library on Monday.  On Monday, he reads the first book with a total of 20 pages.  On Tuesday, he reads the second book with a total of 12 pages.  On Wednesday, he reads the third book.  If he has read a total of 51 pages from Monday to Wednesday, how many pages did he read on Wednesday?\nSolution:<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n", "completion": "<think>\nOkay, let me try to figure out how many pages Nico read on Wednesday. So, the problem says that from Monday to Wednesday, he read 3 books. The first book has 20 pages, the second book has 12 pages, and the third book is what we need to find. The total he read so far is 51 pages. \n\nFirst, let me add up the pages he read on Monday and Tuesday to see how much he has read so far, then subtract that from the total to find out how many pages he read on Wednesday.\n\nStarting with Monday: He read the first book with 20 pages. Then on Tuesday, the second book with 12 pages. Adding those two together: 20 + 12. Let me do the math. 20 plus 10 is 30, plus 2 more is 32. So Monday and Tuesday combined he read 32 pages. \n\nNow, the total pages he read up to Wednesday is 51. Therefore, the pages he read on Wednesday would be 51 minus 32, which is 19. \n\nWait, let me check again. If Monday is 20, Tuesday is 12, then Wednesday is 19. Adding 20 + 12 + 19 equals 51. Let me add them step by step: 20 + 12 is 32, plus 19 is 51. Yes, that adds up. So the answer should be 19 pages on Wednesday.\n\nHmm, but let me make sure I didn't make any mistakes in my arithmetic. First, 20 plus 12. Yep, that's 32. Then 51 minus 32 is indeed 19. So that seems right. I don't see any errors here. \n\nTherefore, Nico read 19 pages on Wednesday.\n</think>\n\nTo determine how many pages Nico read on Wednesday, we start by summing up the pages he read on Monday and Tuesday.\n\n- Pages read on Monday: 20\n- Pages read on Tuesday: 12\n\nAdding these together:  \n$$ 20 + 12 = 32 $$\n\nNow, we know that Nico read a total of **51 pages** from Monday to Wednesday. To find the number of pages he read on Wednesday, we subtract the pages he read on Monday and Tuesday from the total:\n\n$$ 51 - 32 = 19 $$\n\nThus, Nico read **19 pages** on Wednesday. \n\n$$\n\\boxed{19}\n$$<|im_end|>", "source_record": {"question": "Nico borrows 3 books from the library on Monday.  On Monday, he reads the first book with a total of 20 pages.  On Tuesday, he reads the second book with a total of 12 pages.  On Wednesday, he reads the third book.  If he has read a total of 51 pages from Monday to Wednesday, how many pages did he read on Wednesday?", "answer": "From Monday to Tuesday, Nico reads a total of 20 + 12 = <<20+12=32>>32 pages.\nOn Wednesday, he read a total of 51 - 32 = <<51-32=19>>19 pages.\n#### 19", "prompt": "Solve the following grade-school math problem. Show your reasoning and put the final answer in \\boxed{}.\n\nProblem: Nico borrows 3 books from the library on Monday.  On Monday, he reads the first book with a total of 20 pages.  On Tuesday, he reads the second book with a total of 12 pages.  On Wednesday, he reads the third book.  If he has read a total of 51 pages from Monday to Wednesday, how many pages did he read on Wednesday?\nSolution:", "solutions": ["19"], "solution": "19"}, "prompt_tokens": [151644, 872, 198, 50, 3948, 279, 2701, 11972, 34689, 6888, 3491, 13, 6928, 697, 32711, 323, 2182, 279, 1590, 4226, 304, 1124, 79075, 6257, 382, 31198, 25, 74035, 31632, 1811, 220, 18, 6467, 504, 279, 6733, 389, 7014, 13, 220, 1913, 7014, 11, 566, 15804, 279, 1156, 2311, 448, 264, 2790, 315, 220, 17, 15, 6816, 13, 220, 1913, 7589, 11, 566, 15804, 279], "response_tokens": [151667, 198, 32313, 11, 1077, 752, 1430, 311, 7071, 700, 1246, 1657, 6816, 74035, 1349, 389, 7920, 13, 2055, 11, 279, 3491, 2727, 429, 504, 7014, 311, 7920, 11, 566, 1349, 220, 18, 6467, 13, 576, 1156, 2311, 702, 220, 17, 15, 6816, 11, 279, 2086, 2311, 702, 220, 16, 17, 6816, 11, 323, 279, 4843, 2311, 374, 1128, 582, 1184, 311, 1477, 13]}
